    "inspected": "BEAR's wording alone would have given a different or misleading label; the subject or object side was fixed by reading a seeded 12-row sample of the relation's actual rows (random.Random(0).sample, plus the relation's distinct-object set where the sample was ambiguous). The pack's domain_name is 'Wikidata entity' for every relation and so never determines a subject side."
